---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | MetricTether" description="MetricTether privacy policy.">
	<main id="main" class="min-h-screen px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl prose prose-invert">
			<h1 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-[#f1f5f9] mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-[#94a3b8] mb-4">
				MetricTether ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy describes how we handle information collected through metrictether.com.
			</p>
			<h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-[#f1f5f9] mt-8 mb-3">Information we collect</h2>
			<p class="text-[#94a3b8] mb-4">
				When you submit the early-access form, we collect your name, email address, product interest, and any message you provide. We use Plausible Analytics, which is cookieless and does not track individuals.
			</p>
			<h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-[#f1f5f9] mt-8 mb-3">How we use it</h2>
			<p class="text-[#94a3b8] mb-4">
				We use your information to contact you about early access and product updates. We do not sell your data.
			</p>
			<h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-[#f1f5f9] mt-8 mb-3">Contact</h2>
			<p class="text-[#94a3b8]">
				Questions? Email <a href="mailto:info@metrictether.com" class="text-[#38bdf8]">info@metrictether.com</a>.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-10">
				<a href="/" class="text-[#38bdf8] hover:underline">← Back to home</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
